# Lab variant of llama3.1:8b with a fixed 16,384 token context window.
#
# Every client in the lab (n8n nodes, Python agents, the OpenAI-compatible
# endpoint) then gets the same context, because the OpenAI-compatible
# endpoint has no per-request context option. See PLAN.md section 5.
#
# A variant reuses the base model's weights, so it adds no disk space.
#
# Build with:
#   ollama create lab-llama3.1-8b -f models/lab-llama3.1-8b.Modelfile
#
# No SYSTEM prompt on purpose: agent instructions belong in the n8n workflow
# or the Python code, where each agent's prompt is visible and versioned.

FROM llama3.1:8b

PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
